[img]https://31.media.tumblr.com/f0cba22e001ff39e36e37ecb073de05b/tumblr_inline_ng3zjwy8E11suzuys.jpg[/img]
[h1]Antisquad Original[/h1]
1. A support for built-in Steam browser has been added to the game. Now it is not necessary to minimize the game windows to access Facebook and Twitter; 
2. The workshop’s recipes have been moved to a separate menu in store for ease of use; 
3. Some new new recipes have been added; 
4. A ‘treasure chest’ have been added to the game;
5. Some small improvements in the appearance of missions have been added.

[h1]Antisquad - Skirmishes DLC[/h1]
1. Some additional rewards for the completing of skirmish-missions have been added; 
2. The appearance of enemies at some levels have been fixed;
3. The problems of downloading DLC have been fixed;
4. Some new achievements have been added.

